# War Thunder Live Download Manager - Feature Roadmap & TODO

## Version 1.0.0 (Released)
- [x] Download queue with priority ordering
- [x] Pause / resume downloads individually
- [x] Automatic retry on failed downloads
- [x] Bandwidth limit per download and global cap
- [x] Clear progress and status indicators for each item
- [x] Make a settings modal
- [x] Integration with War Thunder live update metadata
- [x] Notification on completion or errors
- [x] Cleanup and separation of functions per individual files for better organization
- [x] Configurable download folder and temp storage
- [x] Automatic cleanup of partial files on cancel
- [x] Ability to import/export download lists
- [x] Logging of download activity and errors
- [x] Option to verify downloaded files against checksums
- [x] UI for filtering and sorting downloads by status
- [x] Support for background operation when app is minimized

## Version 1.1.0 (Current - Released)
- [x] Premium Themes: Dark Mode (Cyber Slate) & Light Mode (Glassmorphism)
- [x] Nation Accent Customizations (US Blue, Germany Green, USSR Red, UK Royal, Japan Crimson)
- [x] Telemetry active vehicle Library filter integration (only show matching skins for active vehicle in My Library)

## Version 1.2.0 (Released)
- [x] Drag & Drop ZIP Installer: Drag local WT Live zip files onto the app dashboard to extract and install them automatically.

## Version 1.3.0 (Released)
- [x] Dynamic Storage Disk Usage Charts: Beautiful visual charts detailing category sizes and space saved history.

## Version 1.4.0 (Todo)
- [ ] Custom Collections and Favorites: Group installed modifications into folders/favorites for fast bulk updates or exports.

## Version 1.5.0 (Todo)
- [ ] Background Auto-Updater Service: Scheduled background checking for new versions and automated updates.
